{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2021-07-27 10:02:00', 'title': 'EPAM STRENGTHENS POSITION AS A CONSULTANCY LEADER IN THE DACH REGION WITH ACQUISITION OF CORE SE', 'text': "BERLIN, JULY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. \xa0(NYSE: EPAM), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DIGITAL PLATFORM ENGINEERING AND DEVELOPMENT SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS ACQUISITION OF CORE SE, A PROFESSIONAL SERVICE PROVIDER SPECIALIZING IN IT STRATEGY AND TECHNOLOGY-DRIVEN TRANSFORMATIONS. FOLLOWING THE RECENT ANNOUNCEMENT OF A NEW BERLIN OFFICE, EPAM'S ACQUISITION OF CORE SE WILL FURTHER EXPAND ITS WESTERN EUROPEAN FOOTPRINT WITHIN THE DACH REGION."}